# # Digital Product Business Automation Example


## Problem

Creators usually manage:

- Payments
- Customer delivery
- Notifications
- Order tracking
- Customer management

Many tasks are still handled manually, which becomes difficult as sales grow.


## Solution

This workflow connects:

Payhip
↓
Make
↓
Telegram
↓
Notion


The automation handles payment events, customer notifications and business tracking automatically.


## Result

Automatically:

- deliver products
- notify customers
- record orders
- track customers
- maintain a simple creator CRM

